# Licensed fonts are served privately from FONT_BASE / FONT_DIR (apps/web/docs/fonts.md).
# Never commit them. Any case: goudy* anywhere, and scripture* font files (woff/woff2/ttf/otf/eot)
# only, so source files named scripture* stay tracked. SortsMillGoudy-* and ShadowsIntoLight.woff2 are not matched.
**/[Gg][Oo][Uu][Dd][Yy]*
**/[Ss][Cc][Rr][Ii][Pp][Tt][Uu][Rr][Ee]*.[Ww][Oo][Ff][Ff]
**/[Ss][Cc][Rr][Ii][Pp][Tt][Uu][Rr][Ee]*.[Ww][Oo][Ff][Ff]2
**/[Ss][Cc][Rr][Ii][Pp][Tt][Uu][Rr][Ee]*.[Tt][Tt][Ff]
**/[Ss][Cc][Rr][Ii][Pp][Tt][Uu][Rr][Ee]*.[Oo][Tt][Ff]
**/[Ss][Cc][Rr][Ii][Pp][Tt][Uu][Rr][Ee]*.[Ee][Oo][Tt]
